{{Skill infobox|id=AnimateGuardiansWeapon}}

'''Animate Guardian's Weapon''' is a [[skill]] granted by the [[unique]] {{il|Chains of Command}}.

Due to the wiki infobox coding, it is malformed. The mod {{c|mod|Trigger this Skill when your Animated Guardian Kills an Enemy}} is for the level 20 version of the skill, while {{c|mod|10% chance to Trigger this Skill when an Animated Weapon Kills an Enemy}} is for the level 18 version.

Compared to {{il|Animate Weapon}}, '''Animate Guardian's Weapon''' does not have the mods {{c|mod|Minions deal #% more Damage}}, {{c|mod|Minions have #% more Attack Speed}} and {{c|mod|Can use Items requiring up to Level #}}. Since it is not a gem (thus cannot have [[quality]]) and cannot animate Lingering Blades, the relevant mods of Animate Weapon are also not present in '''Animate Guardian's Weapon.'''
